WEBVTT

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.110
I have to think of something.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:26.710
Babu.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:44.310
If I don't protect Rea's body...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.580
Good night.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.910
Rea's body is undergoing rigor mortis.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:58.590
At this rate, her body is slowly going to rot away.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.340
At any rate, before rigor mortis lets up,

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:08.430
I have to find a way to preserve her body.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.160
A book on how to preserve a corpse?

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:33.210
Yes, if I'm not mistaken, you've read one before.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.210
I would like to borrow it.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.380
Ah.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:39.710
That book about embalming?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.720
I lent that to a classmate.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:46.220
What kind of middle schooler is that classmate?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.350
Older than an elementary schooler, younger than a high schooler.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.520
No, I already know that...

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.940
You too, Nii. Why do you want that book?

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:55.770
Huh?

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.020
Uh... well.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.320
If you don't have it, that's fine.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:01.900
See ya.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:10.160
He's been acting strange lately...

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.540
Still, the most common one is formaldehyde,

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.670
but the smell is really strong.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.590
I must be careful not to let my family or neighbours find out.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:43.070
Looking at her now, she looks like a normal person sleeping.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:50.870
Hey, Chihiro, Mero, wake up and come down.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.740
All right already!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.330
As I thought, the bed isn't a good place.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.880
Maybe I should move her into the closet.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.130
All right.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.390
Although I say so, I don't know where to look.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.300
Chihiro, what's going on?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.310
Ah, geez...

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.470
I said I'm coming!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.060
Rigor mortis will probably wear off by tonight.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.400
I'm sorry it's small, but wait here until then.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.320
Okay?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.870
W-What was that sound?

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.130
Her stomach?

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.880
Could it possibly be...

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.210
She's hungry?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.010
Well, once you're able to move again...

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.140
...I'll get you something to eat.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.060
Otou-chan, I'm coming down.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.990
Itadakimasu.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.240
The usual breakfast.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:02.040
Hey, did you stop adding fish paste to the miso soup?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.580
Father, that's tofu.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:05.880
Eh?!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.260
Our usual morning scenery.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:24.600
Please let me experience everything normal girls do.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.650
Hey, what do you think is normal?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.860
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:39.450
No, never mind.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.960
Hey, did you stop adding fish paste to the miso soup?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.170
Father, that's tofu.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.090
Eh?!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.270
Thank you.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:06.100
Hm, Rea-san is...

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.490
Ah, if it isn't Ranko-senpai!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.070
Eh, it's you again.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.370
What are you doing way out here?

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.330
Just running the family business.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:26.620
Speaking of which, what are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.750
Um, well, as you know.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:32.340
Our classmate Rea-sama has been absent from school.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:36.840
I got worried, so I came to see how things were going.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.050
Is that so?

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.350
You know, you could have just used the door.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.100
Eh?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.350
Even so, you sure have free time on your hands.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:50.360
But... Rea-sama is our idol.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:55.860
Of course Ranko-senpai's just as much of an idol.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.860
I told you to stop calling me that.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:04.080
Somehow,

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.870
it seems like Rea-sama's appearance has changed a bit.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:13.750
Well, her beauty hasn't changed, but it seems like she's sad...

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.170
Is that so?

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.050
On top of that, she has also been truant lately.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.970
I'm starting to get really worried.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.310
Is that so?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.730
Well, from your perspective, she's just an underclassman,

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.810
so you probably aren't interested.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.860
But to us first years,

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.650
there isn't a single person who isn't interested in her.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.320
Because she really is beautiful.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.910
Ah, look at these pictures.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:41.950
Uh, let me see.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.830
I have a lot of different versions.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.790
So, why don't we start from the photo I think is most beautiful.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.580
What do you think?

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.250
Aren't you spellbound by her gentle, noble figure?

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.460
And this is a shot of three of us together.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.470
This next one is my precious shot of both of us.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.140
Hm...

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:09.810
But it seems like the maids at Rea-sama's house are busy.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.650
I wonder what exactly is going on, you know?

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:16.020
Ah, they are making quite a racket there.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.110
I wonder what happened.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.820
Maybe something happened to Rea-sama?

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.820
Ah, Ranko-senpai!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.290
Today's a school holiday, so we have the day off.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.840
We are going to clean the temple together as a family...

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:51.600
Damn it, I don't have time for this.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.400
Chihiro.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:00.110
I heard you're going to take care of another cat.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.310
Babu just died the other day.

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:03.610
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.240
Dad, you're wrong.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.160
I brought Babu back to life.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.160
I don't get what you're saying.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.290
Hey, Grandpa, you saw Babu, didn't you?

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.920
That's right. That was Babu.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.300
See! Grandpa says so, too.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.300
That's right, that's right.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:30.640
Sada and Babu have both been brought back to life.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.810
That's right, both Sada and Babu...

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.560
Who is Sada?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.560
I was talking about Babu!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.900
Seriously, you two are idiots...

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:40.570
Yeah.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.820
The world should appreciate my resurrection pill more.

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.070
Yes, your resurrection pill-

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.580
Eh?

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.410
G-Grandpa!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.410
What did you just say?

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.080
Eh? Sada?

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.210
Not that!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.040
After that, after that.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:57.580
Eh?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.710
By resurrection pill, do you mean that drug?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.840
On top of that you said "you made it"...

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.180
Huh, did I say that?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.560
You said it.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.020
I don't know anything about that.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.310
I'm taking a bath.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.770
Wait, hold on...

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.770
Hey! We haven't finished cleaning yet.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.150
You're always quick to run off.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.820
Nii, how disgraceful.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:41.040
Hey, what if Grandpa actually did make that drug?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.210
Grandpa is definitely capable of it.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:49.220
If that's the case, then he may also know something...

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.470
...about preserving a resurrected body.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.640
Nii.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.220
Oh!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.680
What do you need all of a sudden?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:01.730
As usual, Nii hasn't been keeping his room clean.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:06.530
Afterwards, I am going to clean Nii's room, too.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.740
Yeah, thanks.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.950
Ah, Mero, wai-

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:16.370
About my room... I already cleaned it today.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.500
What do you mean?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.130
Uh, well...

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:24.760
I just realised I should clean up after myself more often.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:28.510
No, really, you don't need to clean my room.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.510
Really, it's clean.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.180
Yeah, understood.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.020
I don't understand him.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.030
Thanks as always.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.280
Hm? Wanko?

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.570
Ah, if it isn't Ranko-chan.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:53.940
What's going on, Wanko?

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:55.160
You come here every day...

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.290
I just finished deliveries and thought I would drop by.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:01.750
Mero-chan, here's lunch.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.840
Thank you, Wanko-dono.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.800
You're always helping us out.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.130
As I thought, that's it.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.130
Really, this guy only thinks about himself.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:16.060
Wouldn't it be great if he could find a wife like Ranko-chan?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.810
A wife! Really, Oji-sama, you...

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.480
Ah, that's right.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.440
Chihiro, did you hear?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.450
Hm? What is it?

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.950
It seems the Sanka family's daughter ran away last night.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.330
Hm?

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.700
Ah, nothing.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:43.710
And you know, the Sanka family is one of our frequent customers,

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.960
but when I made my delivery, their house was in an uproar.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.340
I guess even a girl like her has her own problems...

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:56.970
Maybe she was reunited with a lover separated by death.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:00.100
Perhaps she is going to elope with her forbidden love!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.310
Separated by death...

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.100
She is dead...

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:08.610
Then the two of them will spend a night
together in a private room overlooking the ocean.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.820
The couple who should have never met.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:21.370
Yet, not knowing this, their bodies and souls grew closer together.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:31.130
Then again, this kind of a girl isn't Chihiro's type either, is she?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.260
Eh?

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:37.760
Huh? But didn't your strange friend say that, too?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.270
That you and that Rea girl are close.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.100
No. How it happened...

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.310
We happened to meet while I was out one night,

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.650
and just ended up talking and stuff.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.740
Hm?

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:55.530
Anyway, why do I have to tell you this?

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.410
Hm, that's because, as your sister,

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:01.080
I have to know about my younger brother's relationships.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.830
That's why I'm telling you it's not like that.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:05.290
Okay, I understand.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.920
Well, I have to help with stuff at home, so I'm heading back.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:11.420
See you later.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.640
What's with that.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.130
What was she trying to say?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.480
Hey, Chihiro!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.220
Hurry up and clean the back of the house, too.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.060
I know!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:27.440
That's right, since I'm already over, I'll borrow another zombie DVD.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.690
So Rea's house is in an uproar, huh...

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:40.080
That's right, her father seemed quite sad.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.700
But it's not like she can return like she is now.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.460
Pardon the intrusion.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:46.450
Hm?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.250
Eh, it's freezing!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.710
What is this?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.960
Is he really using the AC in this weather?

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:59.220
Hmm, let's see. What haven't I borrowed yet?

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.220
Zombie movies really have similar names.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.850
Huh, this isn't what was on the cover!

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.650
Babu.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.580
Which one should I choose?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:26.160
As god says...

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.710
This is the one I watched last time.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.340
Hm?

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.340
Long black hair.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.350
No matter how you think about it, this isn't Chihiro's.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.780
Ah, it must just be my imagination.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.030
Now that I think about it,

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:11.500
Rea's stomach seemed to be growling earlier.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:15.750
If her stomach doesn't work, what would she want to eat?

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.010
Being a zombie...

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.760
No way.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.600
Wait, w-who is it?

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:33.100
Ow!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.520
What's with this strength?

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.520
Wait...

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.280
You're...

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.780
...the Sanka family's...

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.490
Wait!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.500
No...

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.460
Wa- Wait...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.750
Sto-

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:58.920
Wait!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:01.840
Geez...

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.850
You're... wounded.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:14.350
W-What are you laughing at?

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:16.360
Hurry... an ambulance...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.570
Something's... strange.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.620
Don't tell me... this girl also...

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.550
Wanko.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.550
Don't tell me...

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.640
What I just heard in the house...

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:46.430
Don't tell me...

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.390
Wanko!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.560
Are you okay...?

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:00.730
Rea...

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.900
The rigor mortis already wore off?

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.670
C-Chihiro.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.540
Wanko... you...

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.180
Furuya-kun.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:28.930
What is it?

00:21:32.310 --> 00:22:03.420
Eh?

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:05.050
Babu.

00:23:41.810 --> 00:23:43.520
Supporting?

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:45.940
What is she referring to, I wonder?

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:47.860
If its not in good taste to say,

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.030
then maybe there's another way to say it?

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:53.530
Hm, well, I have no choice.

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:55.370
I wonder if this is okay?

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:58.790
Next time: Sankarea.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.870
Episode 6: "Since I met you..."

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:07.320
Do you know what famous zombie movie director Mero's name is based on?

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:09.670
The answer is ... George Romero.
